<title>BELGIUM: EU details concerns on BA/American routes.</title>
<headline>EU details concerns on BA/American routes.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>A European Commission official gave details on Thursday of 14 routes on which the EU executive says British Airways and American Airlines would eliminate all competition if their alliance were to go ahead.</p>
<p>The official told reporters the routes in question were:</p>
<p>London to Baltimore, Charlotte, Phoenix, Pittsburgh, Tampa, Raleigh, Philadelphia and Dallas;</p>
<p>Birmingham to New York and Chicago;</p>
<p>Glasgow to Boston, New York and Chicago;</p>
<p>Manchester to Chicago. -- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
